The dotnet demo: a solution whose Api and Worker reference Pricing, with a Pricing.Tests xUnit project, a tools/Migrate project outside the solution, central package management and NuGet lock files. The change rounds the total in Pricing, which the tests already cover, and bumps Humanizer.Core, which only tools/Migrate uses, in Directory.Packages.props and its lock file. The .NET SDK 8.0.133 wrote the lock files (dotnet restore) and the TRX and Coverlet Cobertura reports under TestResults (dotnet test Shop.sln --logger trx --results-directory TestResults --collect:"XPlat Code Coverage"), at /home/runner/work/demo-observe-dotnet/demo-observe-dotnet on a host named vm. A file that ends without a line break gets one.
-- base/.gitignore --
bin/
obj/
TestResults/
-- base/Directory.Build.props --
<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <RestorePackagesWithLockFile>true</RestorePackagesWithLockFile>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
-- base/Directory.Packages.props --
<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>true</ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageVersion Include="Humanizer.Core" Version="2.13.14" />
    <PackageVersion Include="Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk" Version="17.6.0" />
    <PackageVersion Include="Newtonsoft.Json" Version="13.0.2" />
    <PackageVersion Include="coverlet.collector" Version="6.0.0" />
    <PackageVersion Include="xunit" Version="2.4.2" />
    <PackageVersion Include="xunit.runner.visualstudio" Version="2.4.5" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
